    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh. 3am again and im the only one awake in the whole world it feels like\n\nbeen doing this for 6 years. night shifts in the icu. i used to care so much you know? like i became a nurse because i actually wanted to help people. now i just... go through the motions. today i had to tell a family their dad wasn't going to make it and i didn't feel anything. like nothing. just went through the script\n\ni dont even recognize myself anymore. i think ive seen too much. im so tired of feeling this way -- or not feeling, i guess. im tired of everything. been thinking about stopping everything, not just work... everything",
